  "details": "Add a comment section (similar to Steam's profile comments) directly on user profiles, both on the VRChat website and inside the in-game menu.\n\nKey Features & Moderation:\n\n• Leave Notes: Friends (or users based on privacy settings) can leave short messages or \"+rep\" style notes on a player's profile.\n\n• Owner Control: Profile owners must be able to delete any comment left on their own profile at any time.\n\n• Privacy Settings: Options to restrict who can comment (e.g., Everyone, Friends Only, or Disabled) to prevent spam and harassment.\n\n• Reporting: A standard report option for abusive comments to keep moderation aligned with VRChat's Trust & Safety guidelines.\n\nWhy it would be great:\n\nIt makes profiles feel much more social and personal, letting friends leave fun memories, appreciation notes, or inside jokes directly on each other's pages.",
